# Development files are not governed documents. See meta/RELEASING.md.
#
# The patterns name the development trees one by one, rather than the whole of
# meta/. One file under meta/ ships to an adopter: adopt.sh is a release asset,
# and an adopter reads it before the adopter runs it. Published means governed
# (ACE 10.1), so adopt.sh stays in the sweep.
^meta/RELEASING\.md$
^meta/publish\.sh$
^meta/dist/
^meta/reports/
^meta/research/
^meta/skill/
